{"title":"2026 Bespoked Osaka Showcase: 大阪 – John Watson","link":"https://theradavist.com/2026-bespoked-osaka-showcase-%e5%a4%a7%e9%98%aa","date":1793167526000,"content":"<p><em>In line with our Beautiful Bicycle Reportage from the <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/2026-bespoked-osaka\" target=\"_blank\">2026 Bespoked Osaka</a> showcase, we’ve got a gallery jam-packed with images of Osaka and the show itself by John…</em><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/0a710ecee272b22c64b6078c7a4926d29ee27d4c922feb7ff47bb7b00f7e6f1b.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/e701b93edd63ed6bc2fd93adac62d2eda7621880cf6893875cb1302448aea04f.jpg 640w, /media/0a710ecee272b22c64b6078c7a4926d29ee27d4c922feb7ff47bb7b00f7e6f1b.jpg 1800w, /media/c7c9d4071037c0585f7c3af3b263d78742e3b3865072f686726f2b901f1fa8ec.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Coming off my second Bespoked showcase this year and my third framebuilding show, I was eagerly awaiting to walk through the halls of the Glion Museum.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/6562c673e6c6513cb996b99009cdf6fdc5713a45fcea2984f251f06d83d71168.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/6e68773472b9c7c39827567379f6712c16c61a63ec81229654ea6c1dbfd6dc66.jpg 800w, /media/d37aa45c23a2666d18c045d87d269b77366d78a14cc9ed61565b78cbf4967e24.jpg 1600w, /media/6562c673e6c6513cb996b99009cdf6fdc5713a45fcea2984f251f06d83d71168.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/e1a933e88100fba87280979e8b345d1b40021cf6a278c12ab0461ea9366ce683.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/37243766d13b1472bf4b4537b1629ae301d973810b3138bf8c60943e10865d95.jpg 800w, /media/3c26f1560508666fc4ab72075cc90066f1c172d4b03bd512b0afe5d79b506969.jpg 1600w, /media/e1a933e88100fba87280979e8b345d1b40021cf6a278c12ab0461ea9366ce683.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Knowing the Japanese people’s fondness for traditional bicycle forms, I was expecting a number of quill stems and classic randonneuring bikes, mixed in with a younger generation’s take on modern ATB and tourers.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/03b4576349bd1aadb282220d0d919cd1e8fe529a37dba1e05b95dba3964392be.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/44881ceb819cc552668b15d23d925110e057085dea3b3ef9235a025de41187c1.jpg 800w, /media/e9f64d49005818c3e48f6dd2bf1258041d9eec7e9f0e2584e251485389aa2be8.jpg 1600w, /media/03b4576349bd1aadb282220d0d919cd1e8fe529a37dba1e05b95dba3964392be.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/6e39156f97b35336d97fd46ebc49e88da45f09c2275d3bf360a8b6a104b2922b.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/0b1ad82aa91d9c7b382385c2ed671217afc95ee9791bc2d35878d290f1d45811.jpg 800w, /media/526e58a0ac0eb405b06979ffa8bc8939c31d860628e3b115c271dda7d18d30a1.jpg 1600w, /media/6e39156f97b35336d97fd46ebc49e88da45f09c2275d3bf360a8b6a104b2922b.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>The show did not disappoint. Petor Georgallou’s vision for a Bespoked based in Japan was on full display, mixing traditional companies like MKS, Nitto, and Honjo, alongside pinnacle shops like Circles and Blue Lug, as well as framebuilders from all generations. Welcomed were Asia-Pacific builders like D3 and Prova, as well as a number of European talents.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/4dcbe0d2d6cca8a10ffe8b4b9dfb2ac2ec9ce6992b97d54f7cc48002e874d8cd.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/6aad76f079882ecd7cb0243ffb55317508ee2ab14d87d793b969b148b3c65fcf.jpg 800w, /media/4dcbe0d2d6cca8a10ffe8b4b9dfb2ac2ec9ce6992b97d54f7cc48002e874d8cd.jpg 1600w, /media/50744176c8dde57dbb39d36974586bc8de9e8103385a978bac455a82c4a3b8dc.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/e93df8682a2156c1f2dcb8333bc35bbd1cca48c140b7f0f69325af4ea357d7fe.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/36a9907bf97e69a226bd8d7df7be01c331a3372b99ba184d4c1c8e55702e0757.jpg 800w, /media/e93df8682a2156c1f2dcb8333bc35bbd1cca48c140b7f0f69325af4ea357d7fe.jpg 1600w, /media/19b0fd969325bef5b695157218e07eb61adbb1c0e6702f49c51c86a6d6fdc97a.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/db1b05d7b9fc8bd9ffaa51bc029600d79f7b690e3566424fd5d30895baf51c8d.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/ef7166e095b51ee1f2e859b2fda5d84161dee6b6c9f42e6d8139caf92cde9ce3.jpg 800w, /media/db1b05d7b9fc8bd9ffaa51bc029600d79f7b690e3566424fd5d30895baf51c8d.jpg 1600w, /media/7c8f964a3eced71cf477fc740cc28461205970b2a9ef0e073362180438808b87.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Bespoked has always felt global, but Osaka brought a regional specificity. Osaka’s vibes as a city are much more laid-back and slower-paced than Tokyo, with local dining, shopping, and entertainment just a short subway trip away.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f116babeccd8d6b4924d9abb120777c20d908a6e16c8d1eec8494c3198ae983d.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/fdeec8dc4ea1d3605c3c7ecb774ab9294b8c5d99fb82a7e8a34de969f753bf88.jpg 800w, /media/f116babeccd8d6b4924d9abb120777c20d908a6e16c8d1eec8494c3198ae983d.jpg 1600w, /media/5fffd073a1239431d960d8b3f23fa18c38513a2e26c73c104fcad0ff00858598.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/6044f3cc56f420c6ec3b257470fd0b0b6688af969bc174c6e00e0557ca3432f1.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/934f9bc6209f1a95d8ef1aacc66c1ee7a97fb99f789dc845032615741aa40c3a.jpg 800w, /media/6044f3cc56f420c6ec3b257470fd0b0b6688af969bc174c6e00e0557ca3432f1.jpg 1600w, /media/8fc2368becf8afbc55048640e704e300e1378a198d1614f7323830cd05d56329.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/2e57fcb35228152036b6825be9ecd335f1494b5c4592db520f8a6acae96f6aa4.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/d3fe1a345dfbd437a8f9c6836bf7b8db26328fe3fb5681a78d8265eb2480841a.jpg 800w, /media/2e57fcb35228152036b6825be9ecd335f1494b5c4592db520f8a6acae96f6aa4.jpg 1600w, /media/520bb7d8b23d4dd61ce73cfb2a7e587ee3386c44bbf00044c219042639eacb6f.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>The city is beautiful, expansive, and vibrant, which made for a relaxing experience post-showcase each night.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/8d5cad212787538840827b2c4e0d05683b9b0bb5c55e3a441f63677f12f3ff98.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/41aebaf0edcfd42bd976f16b6ef95d8a1054a29b19ae1f2540c023264f9ab9c1.jpg 800w, /media/a65d5fe8c7144758e5cb265855e2942b41a4670e5027d70d2dc9efb4131ee025.jpg 1600w, /media/8d5cad212787538840827b2c4e0d05683b9b0bb5c55e3a441f63677f12f3ff98.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/4255f28d9fa35b56836172518ff60ff242d90540b91baeab27ebe8927ba78e9f.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/c198a9f50cf57e4b006851f310ebf11fb3f8f18b91a5c125dc44a8754a5af2ce.jpg 800w, /media/3ef14162803f3a9b2dbf8ed0a4b74c3c945c3a2989b5c0bdde8933305183a371.jpg 1600w, /media/4255f28d9fa35b56836172518ff60ff242d90540b91baeab27ebe8927ba78e9f.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>My takeaway from the event is a newfound reverence for Japanese builders, seeing many in person for the first time, as well as the utmost respect for brands like Cherubim who’ve spent decades wowing framebuilder showcase attendees. Seeing them on their home turf was even more special.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/b5db36f158a501dcc63553e4c3df3715a36a7c5921d05f603402de494ee8852c.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/b3c9a626843fef0fe51346680050c52c9e877f16f5bfe8289d1a6916fbb9780d.jpg 800w, /media/b5db36f158a501dcc63553e4c3df3715a36a7c5921d05f603402de494ee8852c.jpg 1600w, /media/60f358917a3d1a0f825a5afaddd766cb78755f96d5c77229b7ca0d20356f27a1.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f0a29417bb4c96868c644fba4b76443601f2a90c519dbcb6dd08125556b45f27.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/a3c9632d6c875459d30b2a81cd452ecd1ef84cdba0387ea44082a4ca43935e7a.jpg 800w, /media/f0a29417bb4c96868c644fba4b76443601f2a90c519dbcb6dd08125556b45f27.jpg 1600w, /media/eb33f882f8070768b4f492498401ec13172b375fe86b66cda03143ef681fb7a8.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/292fd6c34e635e44bde8635e9949c677b3c8ea04e01ff98e6ded25cc109a9601.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/58363c0cc6b36b089cff331dd7bb027baa0d4404ba184f3b153dd7d6f607f857.jpg 800w, /media/292fd6c34e635e44bde8635e9949c677b3c8ea04e01ff98e6ded25cc109a9601.jpg 1600w, /media/29c18d0856adda419df46a8082626b54a2d34b0d31a95c532e00a2779a1fb4d4.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>To the readers of The Radavist and longtime fans from the Prolly is Not Probably days that stopped me and said hello, I appreciate you. A special shout-out to the <a href=\"https://shop.circles-jp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Circles</a> and <a href=\"https://sim-works.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sim Works</a> fam; thank you for making this trip possible. Much love for the Blue Lug posse, who brought energy and one sick employee bike parking show in itself. Thanks to the Crumbworks team for keeping it fun!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/0dea3519d7ca416bd7c981847c4a6762bd77ab7eff75cc19f1b6621226389f27.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/9b67f1d558739447b450a6c779a3926e2dd54a86a8bd8a48b00638acb65c9e08.jpg 800w, /media/0dea3519d7ca416bd7c981847c4a6762bd77ab7eff75cc19f1b6621226389f27.jpg 1600w, /media/234c7c548c3222da629b38cc30a077aaf9a44848c571d169a45883ce49c90d34.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/a3b61e35d2f281aaa0ab7c010bcebb67a45f2b3995030865c6097db88edddabb.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/b297e2c8b695ca3c67f7e2745e1b586b8ac54ed3e7604b8b8ac74ef4b0920ae2.jpg 800w, /media/a3b61e35d2f281aaa0ab7c010bcebb67a45f2b3995030865c6097db88edddabb.jpg 1600w, /media/e291706bb7b1b07110e7749b095866242c7421c667ed81872033251cf62c2294.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/cc9c67139879d521454e18835eaeb6302a9314eae3986f085caf03d71b386281.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/a722923d4a31921f5bd3b30918d1d32e40d84cc7d51b147f05d021547da5a7fe.jpg 800w, /media/cc9c67139879d521454e18835eaeb6302a9314eae3986f085caf03d71b386281.jpg 1600w, /media/87594ee88200db29c4e9ab9cf49b5f571f9a6a2590e9d540ecefb183767bffdd.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>I really also want to thank our readership for clicking into these articles, commenting, sharing the posts on social media, and all the global chatter you create around this funky little corner of the internet. This has been my life’s work, and I couldn’t be more proud to call it home with all of you.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/b1182a20d012efc1575f80951a5a105c8106f63d9a1eee43039c22c4a85c5d5a.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/401b56ed0902e660fde592d4d1c864de97985d3ea9cf748c3ad70b4274729789.jpg 800w, /media/b1182a20d012efc1575f80951a5a105c8106f63d9a1eee43039c22c4a85c5d5a.jpg 1600w, /media/6b1d8b23e2e2eb30bae4f6d05df724e26fc67aa1183d000778c92f255dc7a6be.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/1c2ba46bffd15cd03e03a00205d53b426b814566af98f864d639a2153c362534.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/65a30c0f1177abc9ed7bb651fbdbc4328db744815dd67ee4f665f64e0be03667.jpg 800w, /media/1c2ba46bffd15cd03e03a00205d53b426b814566af98f864d639a2153c362534.jpg 1600w, /media/31021b10cb7ea0753c160639ed126a9735e8e671638db270b6c23b04e2a6cf25.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/02f31b3f8084551be23957873a9aa3b789e0bf25f553e42f0f364f06779f3bb0.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/07b81d87b8057d8c43a73aedcd63834d173cf6b48e4325a8fc300b9908ccff9d.jpg 800w, /media/02f31b3f8084551be23957873a9aa3b789e0bf25f553e42f0f364f06779f3bb0.jpg 1600w, /media/c1b54c5ae7d7bdd13e6c836ae065ea9f99f98de05fe58c32d68bc35544c8bdbd.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>The Japanese concept of ikigai – 生きがい – “reason for being” is on display at this show. While not intrinsically linked to being profit-driven, your ikigai can be derived from asking four questions: What are you good at? What do you love? What does the world need? And what can you be paid for? This concept lies at the root of artistic pursuit, a passion for creation, and the drive to fill a needed niche in society. For me, my ikigai is documenting the work of makers, largely in this cycling space and I feel so fulfilled documenting shows like Bespoked.</p>\n<p>Many thanks to the people of Japan (and beyond) and the host city of Osaka for showing up. I can’t wait to return next year.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f9fd5eea3c0bbb108d8df7a5414991806d8c0427188ae9a2c2b7679de681aeb5.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/9954310137f6738ee011aefc3c7c315dab21a4b533d1f5b27859b3e5032d4c21.jpg 640w, /media/f9fd5eea3c0bbb108d8df7a5414991806d8c0427188ae9a2c2b7679de681aeb5.jpg 1800w, /media/21b9972d77bdd0aa14d9f6047ffd04feaefb08e2579ae6221c6854d95f0e7f58.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><strong>The Radavist thanks <a href=\"https://circles-jp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Circles Japan</a> for sponsoring our 2026 Bespoked Osaka coverage and our independent Reportage!</strong></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/2026-bespoked-osaka-showcase-%e5%a4%a7%e9%98%aa\">2026 Bespoked Osaka Showcase: 大阪</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"John Watson","comments":"https://theradavist.com/2026-bespoked-osaka-showcase-%e5%a4%a7%e9%98%aa#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"c7a4c2b2f5972a863023e5499beefcff18548e742ec9e8ba79b66adbb753e3b6","category":"Cycling"}